215
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:21,000
branded or unbranded operator. A branded

216
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:23,480
dealer, one who operates under a major

217
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:25,840
oil company's name, buys fuel at what is

218
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:27,680
called the dealer tank wagon price, set

219
00:07:25,840 --> 00:07:29,360
by the refiner or distributor. The

220
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:31,000
branded price includes a premium for the

221
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:32,600
national marketing support, the

222
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:35,120
proprietary additive packages in the

223
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:37,240
fuel, and guaranteed supply priority if

224
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:38,840
